Third-party software / Logiciels tiers
--------------------------------------

The Windows distribution contains third-party software under separate
licenses (Python, FastAPI, Uvicorn, Pydantic, pywebview and their
dependencies). Their license texts are installed in "licenses/third-party".
It also carries the SimConnect library from the Microsoft Flight Simulator
SDK, used privately by FlowXav and never installed into the system.

Aircraft data / Données des avions
----------------------------------

Aircraft profiles describe where controls are on screen and how to read their
state. Field and event names come from the public SDKs that aircraft
developers publish for third-party tools (for example the PMDG SDK). FlowXav
contains no manual excerpt, no aircraft model and no proprietary file from
those products; the aircraft itself must be owned and installed by the user.

